 plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TEY4cngWy-MQ7kNvwEBNI4R&_nc_oc=AdkTBa67jjR6sxdQC0z9K9JA6t0SAzV12S4DTDqA3llcK_yrLy_lsStYZBgHR-uc2kA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxRH3kjQZduN-B8F9LmHODLuXwem8IwXCQyz5YeQYNECA&oe=69AAB8F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XVlPAROfF_kQ7kNvwEseACP&_nc_oc=AdmZe56UENvvW1ALWa4effJ8PjDdeQUrEreiGGxTcJXmPPMMnAtSushOQanTyzPsFxs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxXGEbC3IiT3jqL8Ipg39XsmJKFRfNfyJwaBAW_d-y5rg&oe=69AABA56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qYW5Q4XFn-wQ7kNvwGYuNGl&_nc_oc=AdnGawLTWIYeE8VECW0no-ss5u1Ub4UyCUZNhfrZvxHInZum5-ANkW9juGl7tVXpxNM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwM98ukg38P0nQ1R0sZhiLVl8kQpfhCFhjLU5Whsd-pAg&oe=69AACF77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v